# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Xcode / Swift
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

## Build output
build/
DerivedData/
*.o
*.hmap
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

## Per-user Xcode state (window layout, breakpoints, selected scheme).
## Never commit these — they churn on every open and conflict constantly.
xcuserdata/
*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/

## Xcode workspace checks / settings noise
*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/IDEWorkspaceChecks.plist
*.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/IDEWorkspaceChecks.plist
*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/WorkspaceSettings.xcsettings
*.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/WorkspaceSettings.xcsettings

## Legacy Xcode cruft
*.pbxuser
!default.pbxuser
*.mode1v3
!default.mode1v3
*.mode2v3
!default.mode2v3
*.perspectivev3
!default.perspectivev3
*.moved-aside
*.xccheckout
*.xcscmblueprint

## Swift Package Manager working dirs
.build/
.swiftpm/

## NOTE ON Package.resolved — deliberately NOT ignored.
## For an application (as opposed to a library) the resolved file pins the exact
## dependency versions that were built and shipped. For a security product this is
## supply-chain evidence: it records precisely which MSAL version is in a given
## release, and lets a build be reproduced months later. Keep it tracked.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# macOS Finder junk (not covered by GitHub's Swift template)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon
._*

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets — this repo is PUBLIC. Nothing credential-shaped may land here.
# The app is a public client (PKCE, no client secret), so there should never be a
# secret to commit; these patterns exist to catch mistakes, not to enable them.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.local.xcconfig
Secrets.xcconfig
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest
AuthKey_*.p8
.env
.env.*

## Ad-hoc scratch files that tend to accumulate real tenant data
scratch/
*-scratch.*
*.tenant.json
graph-response*.json
